---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
import Avatar from '../components/Avatar.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const posts=(await getCollection('posts',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.date.valueOf()-a.data.date.valueOf());
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div><Avatar /><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SPACE FOR EVERYDAY LIFE</p><h1>{profile.intro.split('\n').map(line=><span>{line}</span>)}</h1><p class="intro">{profile.bio}</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">认识一下我 <span>↗</span></a><div class="hero-note"><span class="dot"></span> 慢一点，也没关系。</div></div><figure class="art"><div class="landscape"><div class="moon"></div><div class="hill back"></div><div class="hill front"></div><div class="vase"></div><div class="stem one"></div><div class="stem two"></div><div class="leaf l1"></div><div class="leaf l2"></div><div class="leaf l3"></div></div><figcaption>把平凡的瞬间，轻轻收藏。 <span>— 日常切片 01</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class="entries"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LATEST PAGES</p><h2>最近写下的</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/journal/">全部手记 ↗</a></div>{posts.slice(0,3).map((post,i)=><a class="entry" href={'/posts/'+post.id+'/'}><span class="entry-num">0{i+1}</span><div><div class="meta">{post.data.category} <span> / </span> {post.data.date.toISOString().slice(0,10).replaceAll('-','.')}</div><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.description}</p></div><span class="entry-arrow">↗</span></a>)}</section><section class="subscribe"><div class="subscribe-icon">✳</div><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S STAY IN TOUCH</p><h2>偶尔更新，一直在这里。</h2><p>把这份小小的日常，放进你的阅读器。</p></div><a class="button" href="/subscribe/">订阅我的 RSS ↗</a></section><p class="demo">当前文章与个人介绍为示例内容，可在内容后台替换。</p></Layout>